<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	11.70 /11.55  12.00 /11.85   12.50 /12.30</p>
<p>BPI			11.80 /11.725 11.95 /11.90   12.50 /12.30</p>
<p>Citibank		 11.525/11.425 11.80 /11.70   12.15 /12.05</p>
<p>Metrobank		11.85 /11.70  12.00 /11.80   12.75 /12.50</p>
<p>PNB			11.80 /11.70  12.00 /11.90   12.50 /12.40</p>
<p>Security Bank	  11.85 /11.60  12.10 /11.85   13.00 /12.40</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   11.70 /11.55  12.00 /11.90   12.55 /12.40</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
